      "_id": "0dd027d33ce769c6",
      "name": "Gadgetry",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/explosion.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>GADGETRY 1<br>You carry a compact kit of specialized devices covering your core tactical needs. Produce mundane small tools or simple devices appropriate to your concept as a free action. Once per Breather, prepare temporary single-use gadgets equal to INT modifier + Rank Bonus, minimum 1.<br>Gadget Strike (Tier 1 At-Will, Action): Short range. Attack 1d20 + INT + Rank Bonus vs Dodge. Hit: default damage track based on device. Strong Success: target rolls 1d20 + CON vs Power Effect Value or is Shaken until end of your next Turn.<br>Gadget Kit (Tier 1): Produce small mundane or near-future tools such as lockpick, glass cutter, rebreather, cable spool, adhesive patch, forensic scanner, signal detector, or similar.<br>Gear Dependent: Gadgetry powers require kit, belt, pouch system, or equipment loadout. Grants +1 Power Pick.</p>",
        "subtype": "Power Set",
        "action": "Passive",
        "category": "Power Set",
        "source": "Heroic 5e v2.4",
